{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71823","main_id":71823,"main_title":"守乡人","main_description":"佳节已至，轻策庄的阿芷却在为药材的问题而烦恼…","chapter_title":"守乡人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7182302,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182302,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":718230215,"next_line_ids":[718230216],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":213901,"speaker_text_hash":4113594989,"speaker":"阿芷","speaker_raw":"阿芷","text_hash":2213661378,"text":"另外一味是生长在河滩上的新鲜嘟嘟莲，入药后可以祛湿散淤。","raw_text":"另外一味是生长在河滩上的新鲜嘟嘟莲，入药后可以祛湿散淤。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182302.json"}
